lse,"text":"At first, she is wary of the main character, but since she was interested in magic, she is easily manipulated by him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she lets her guard down, she is raped by the protagonist, and becomes a vassal to provide monsters."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42820"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"第一王女・ティータ付きのメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王女と歳も近いことから、身の回りの世話だけでなく話し相手も務める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王女からも信頼されており、彼女から欠点等を指摘されれば耳を傾ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事は手際よくしっかりこなすが、性格がやや幼く好奇心旺盛なことから、隙を見せることも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20789","sourceWorkId":"9122","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ティータお付きのメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王女とは歳も近く、身の回りの世話以外に話し相手も務めている。 主であるティータを心から尊敬するも、その欠点を進言できる 優秀なメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目・中身共に少々子供っぽいが仕事の時はしっかり者。 しかし、普段は好奇心旺盛で幼さから見せる隙も多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の事は警戒するが、魔術に興味津々という性分を利用 されて○辱され、敬愛するティータを犯す為の化け物を生み出す 母胎にされてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92815"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20789","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20789","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20789","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20789","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20789","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fcd24309d298e5965c83a920f4a1d646aefdf37ddfd1f540c82121853e22c70.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c8aa3d77aeacc147bed6693b3ebf20bf2ef758dd043e14ac916974962d9de166.webp","width":115,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"なかせひな","creatorId":"vndb:s926","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s926","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s926","name":"なかせ ひな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:271330:92815:12719:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42823","characterName":"ミレーユ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92816","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271330"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20790"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42823"},"originalCharacterName":"ミレーユ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"91"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A female knight who leads the guards, and is dedicating to protect the royal family from harm."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a warrior woman who trains hard and resides in the castle. She is calm, collected, and is an excellent leader. She is trusted by man from the royals to the knights."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is only really good at swordsmanship, and is not well-versed in sex. Although she is a loyal knight, she is suspicious of the older sister, and pays close attention to her and the main character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He finds it annoying and ends up raping her. But despite the humiliation, she remains rebellious and tries to cut the protagonist's neck whenever she can."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42823"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"王と国に忠誠を誓う、親衛隊の隊長。女騎士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女だてらに指導力、統率力に優れ、王や王女、兵に至るまで全幅の信頼を得ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は冷静沈着で、常に訓練を怠らない武人肌の女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反面、剣一筋で生きてきたことから、性に関しては奥手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"第二王女・リーゼの不穏な行動を怪しんでいるようだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20790","sourceWorkId":"9122","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主君の身辺警護に尽力する親衛隊の長を務めている女騎士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は城に常駐して訓練に励む武人肌の女性。冷静沈着で 指導力・統率力に優れ、兵達から王や王女達に至るまで信頼は厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣の道一筋に生きてきたので性に関して非常に奥手。王家に忠誠を 誓うも妹王女の事を怪しんでおり、彼女と主人公に注意を払っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それを鬱陶しく思った主人公に犯されてしまうのだが、度重なる 恥○にもめげず、隙あらば主人公の寝首をかこうと、反抗的な態度を 崩さない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92816"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20790","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20790","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20790","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20790","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20790","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c6298b2801d02ac253e487a32fe39153ffeebe5d3d63fad904d0eb67dda3675d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b4445f9521462a7d3c08e31e18278d1b9cb6ec356fee3c03f334accbc8dd530.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:271330:92816:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42824","characterName":"ティータ・ルーヴェンス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92813","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271330"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20787"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42824"},"originalCharacterName":"ティータ・ルーヴェンス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The first princess of the kingdom, she is an optimistic, well-behaved. and intelligent girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is humble and cheerful, which makes her loved by many."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is knowledgeable, but naive, and treats the most suspicious characters without discrimination."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is worried about her sister, who hates her for succeeding the throne."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her quiet demeanor, she is strong-willed, and has the drive to take the stand in a difficult situation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, her body adapts quickly to pleasure, and she struggles with the pleasures of training and being a noble princess."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42824"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大国・ルーヴェンス王国の第一王女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眉目秀麗、品行方正、頭脳明晰にして、王家であることを気取らず、誰からも愛されるような明るく優しい女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした物腰ながら芯は強く、どのような状況においても毅然な態度を取れる気丈さを持つ。しかし人を疑うことを知らず、世間に疎いが故に、主人公の接近を許してしてまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王位継承権のことで双子の妹に憎まれていることも知っており、そのことで胸を痛めている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20787","sourceWorkId":"9122","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"眉目秀麗、品行方正、頭脳明晰にして大国ルーヴェンス王国の第一王女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気取らない、明るい性格で誰からも愛されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"博識だが世間知らずで、見るからに怪しい主人公にも分け隔てなく接する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王位継承権の事で双子の妹リーゼに憎まれていることが気がかり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとした物腰ながら芯は強く、窮地に陥っても毅然とした態度を取る気丈さがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、そんな性分に対して身体は快楽への順応が早く、調教による快楽と、王女としての鉄の理性がせめぎ合い、苦悶の日々を送る事になる"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92813"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20787","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20787","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20787","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20787","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20787","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fbb6a32aab54d20ae4cb05148609f0d4f8c6c6bbc25f05f00de82dae86a0a0d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e909bdfd0405d74cdec5210f0cc03eadaf7f3f25b0cfb04cf2764c1c9ada45b.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白井うさぎ","creatorId":"vndb:s3002","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3002","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3002","name":"白井 うさぎ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:271330:92813:26282:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42825","characterName":"リーゼ・ルーヴェンス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92814","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271330"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20788"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42825"},"originalCharacterName":"リーゼ・ルーヴェンス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Overbearing, arrogant, and will stop at nothing to achieve her goals. She used to be pure like Tita, but the succession to thrones has distorted her personality to the point where she hates Tita."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For better or worse, she is more human than Tita, and thus more prone to flaws and mistakes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she keeps others at arms length, she has a secret desire to be accepted by someone for who she is."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She first hired the protagonist and is treated like a client, but he only sees her as someone to take revenge on, and she too is raped and humiliated like Tita."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Furthermore, as her training progresses, she becomes dependent on the protagonist, who has been rejecting others for years, and wants to be spoiled by him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42825"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大国・ルーヴェンス王国の第二王女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前は、姉・ティータと同様に誰からも慕われる純粋な王女だったが、王位継承権が原因で性格が歪み、高圧的で傲慢な性格に変じてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人を拒むような態度を取る彼女だが、本当は自分を認めて欲しい、という欲求が強く、自らも主人公に調○され、次第に依存し始める。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20788","sourceWorkId":"9122","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ティータの双子の妹で、ルーヴェンス王国の第二王女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高圧的で傲慢、目的の為には手段を選ばない性格。以前はティータ と同様に純粋だったが、王位継承権が原因で性格が歪み、ティータを憎 むようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良くも悪くも人間味が濃く、ティータに比べて隙が多い。 誰も寄せ付けない態度を取り続けるも内心では、誰かに自分を 認めてほしい、という欲求を強く抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その事がきっかけとなり、調教が進むと他人を拒み続けてきた 彼女は主人公に依存し、甘え始める。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92814"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20788","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"c","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20788","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20788","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20788","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20788","sourceWorkId":"9122","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d32133cc29dd036be7b81fa110952db95427c78df03c1506eebd35a22b46aeb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d5e26c9d819ce25c99884f05f0c41bd73adffbf4003e5839ccf8e5c97fbaa235.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"儀武ゆう子","creatorId":"vndb:s263","sourcePersonId":"vndb: